      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "college applicants and their families",
      "description": "The meme is designed for individuals who are currently navigating or have recently experienced the stress of college admissions, including high school students, parents, and educators. The humor relies on the shared cultural understanding of the intense emotional and social pressure associated with college rejection, making it particularly resonant with this demographic.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
